    {
      "stepId": "submission-confirmation",
      "title": "Application submitted",
      "elements": [],
      "behaviours": [],
      "markdownContent": "## What happens next\n\nYour application for a swimming or wading pool permit has been sent to Environmental Health.\n\nEnvironmental Health will review your application. They may contact you if they need more information or need to inspect the pool. They will let you know the outcome and what you need to do next."
